<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Huaneng Power started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Huaneng Power started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan inititated coverage of Huaneng Power International Inc, which owns and operates power plants in China, with a &quot;buy&quot; rating, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- John Hanley, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
